Files under services/graph/codecontext/ are derived from RepoGraph. The
following changes were made to the upstream code:

  * Language support was extended from Python only to Python, JavaScript,
    Java, and C, using the per-language tree-sitter distribution packages
    (tree_sitter_python, tree_sitter_javascript, tree_sitter_java,
    tree_sitter_c) instead of a single bundled grammar.
  * Parser language selection was migrated to the tree-sitter >= 0.22 API
    (assignment to Parser.language) from the removed Parser.set_language().
  * A retrieval layer (services/graph/codecontext/retriever.py) was added to
    resolve a "relative_path::type::name" query to a graph node and return its
    bounded neighbourhood. This module is original to this project.
  * Graph construction was adapted to be driven by an external caller
    (services/agents/Utils/Graph.py) rather than by a command-line entry point.

